\* All TLC check configs for AntflyMlCompilerPublication.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyMlCompilerPublication.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStaleCompile = FALSE
    BuggyMissingExternalInput = FALSE
    BuggyWrongOutputSelection = FALSE
    BuggyFallbackPublish = FALSE
    BuggyPartialArtifactPublish = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    ExportMaterializesRequiredRuntimeInputs
    ExportIncludesCompilerOutputs
    CompileUsesFreshCompleteExport
    FailedCompileArtifactNotVisible
    RuntimePublishesOnlyFreshCompleteArtifact
    RuntimeOutputSelectionIsExact
    RuntimeGateFailsClosed
    Safety

==== BadFallbackPublish
\* Expected-failure config: runtime publishes an executor despite a fallback
\* partition and a fail-closed runtime gate.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStaleCompile = FALSE
    BuggyMissingExternalInput = FALSE
    BuggyWrongOutputSelection = FALSE
    BuggyFallbackPublish = TRUE
    BuggyPartialArtifactPublish = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    RuntimeGateFailsClosed

==== BadMissingInput
\* Expected-failure config: partition export omits a required parameter or
\* semantic KV cache input.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStaleCompile = FALSE
    BuggyMissingExternalInput = TRUE
    BuggyWrongOutputSelection = FALSE
    BuggyFallbackPublish = FALSE
    BuggyPartialArtifactPublish = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    ExportMaterializesRequiredRuntimeInputs

==== BadOutputSelection
\* Expected-failure config: runtime publication leaks semantic KV side outputs
\* instead of exposing only the selected final graph output.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStaleCompile = FALSE
    BuggyMissingExternalInput = FALSE
    BuggyWrongOutputSelection = TRUE
    BuggyFallbackPublish = FALSE
    BuggyPartialArtifactPublish = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    RuntimeOutputSelectionIsExact

==== BadPartialArtifact
\* Expected-failure config: a failed compiler leaves a partial artifact visible
\* to publication logic.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStaleCompile = FALSE
    BuggyMissingExternalInput = FALSE
    BuggyWrongOutputSelection = FALSE
    BuggyFallbackPublish = FALSE
    BuggyPartialArtifactPublish = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    FailedCompileArtifactNotVisible

==== BadStaleCompile
\* Expected-failure config: compiler artifact is built from a stale export after
\* the source graph version changes.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStaleCompile = TRUE
    BuggyMissingExternalInput = FALSE
    BuggyWrongOutputSelection = FALSE
    BuggyFallbackPublish = FALSE
    BuggyPartialArtifactPublish = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    RuntimePublishesOnlyFreshCompleteArtifact
